==================================================================
                       Frequency Analyzer
==================================================================

The frequency analyzer is a class with one method that analyze an array of bytes.
it contains only one method named Analyzes who takes a given byte array and
calculates the frequency of each unique byte. Each byte is converted to an unsigned
integer (0–255) before being stored in the frequency table.

Method :
    Analyze() : HashMap<Integer, Integer>
        Method that return a HashMap with the key as frequency, how many times a symbol as
        been encounter, and a value as symbol who represent a unique symbol of the array bytes.